</ID(AD000000-0000-0000-ADBE-      108669)/K[688 0 R 689 0 R 690 0 R 691 0 R 702 0 R 703 0 R 704 0 R 705 0 R 12074 0 R 12075 0 R 12076 0 R 12073 0 R]/P 444 0 R/S/Sect>>endobj705 0 obj<</A 706 0 R/Alt(40.0% of families/carers of 2019-20 entrants aged 25 and over were working in a paid job, compared to 77.6% of Australians aged 25 to 64. The population percentage is from ABS Labour Force Statistics, Original Series, as at 30 June 2020. 38% of respondent\s are spouses/partners, 30% are mothers, 6% are fathers, 8% are sisters, 3% are brothers, 9% are other family members and 5% are others.\r\n86.1% of those in a paid job work 15 hours or more per week.\r\n51.7% of families/carers of 2019-20 entrants aged 2\5 and over said that they \(and/or their partner\) were able to work as much as they wanted.\r\nOf the families/carers who did not work as much as they liked, 12.3% said that the availability of jobs was a barrier, 18.8% said that insufficient flexibility\ of jobs was a barrier, and 90.1% identified the situation with their family member with disability as a barrier to working more.\r\n␀)/K[708 0 R 33]/P 687 0 R/Pg 105 0 R/S/Figure>>endobj709 0 obj<</C[/CM6/CM66]/ID(AD000000-0000-0000-ADBE-      103550)/S/H5>>endobj710 0 obj<</C[/CM6/CM66]/ID(AD000000-0000-0000-ADBE-      103552)/S/P>>endobj711 0 obj<</C[/CM6/CM66]/ID(AD000000-0000-0000-ADBE-      103554)/S/H5>>endobj712 0 obj<</C[/CM6/CM66]/ID(AD000000-0000-0000-ADBE-      103556)/S/P>>endobj713 0 obj<</ID(AD000000-0000-0000-ADBE-      108752)/S/Span>>endobj714 0 obj<</ID(AD000000-0000-0000-ADBE-      108753)/K 0/P 12073 0 R/Pg 115 0 R/S/Span>>endobj11038 0 obj[603 0 R 604 0 R 605 0 R 609 0 R 610 0 R 612 0 R 613 0 R 615 0 R 616 0 R 617 0 R 618 0 R 619 0 R 620 0 R 624 0 R 11039 0 R 11040 0 R 11041 0 R 11042 0 R 11043 0 R 11044 0 R 11045 0 R 11047 0 R 11049 0 R null null null null null null 625 0 R 625 0 R 625 0 R 625 0 R 625 0 R 625 0 R 625 0 R null 626 0 R null 12077 0 R 621 0 R]endobj110